    "causal_summary": "The shipped `mcp-obsidian` plugin docs carried real correctness defects the 006 research surfaced: advanced-canvas told the AI to never author cross-portal edges (a now-resolved, operation-blocking `VERIFY`); every notion-bases `database.md` column key was a wrong guess the plugin silently ignores, and the mandatory `notion-bases: true` marker was documented nowhere; meta-bind taught a `=now()` timestamp the plugin has no function for; claudian instructed operators to author `.claude/mcp.json`, a file Claudian deletes; dataview stated two facts (inline-field multiline, fixed DQL command order)",
